{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.poster.avif?t=1769563175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.webm?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/0fcc45f78a3c2e1393c7e6784c60451c.mp4?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Crystal Conquest is a <strong>Free-To-Play</strong> VR game where you <strong>control the elements</strong> and battle for victory. Imagine the elemental magic of Avatar in VR across fighting, MOBA, and level based campaign modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as elemental mages - 4 available by default, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which spells to take into battle, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your in-match shop - choose your potions, wands and other items, unlock more over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different modes to suit your mood: Duel (1v1), Conquest MOBA (3v3) or Gauntlet (players vs waves of enemies)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player or Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private lobbies available, bring your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills-based matchmaking to pair you with equal opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the game's future by communicating with the Studio on Discord </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/fb16b1bc2e8d96d03c76ea8e98ffb12b.poster.avif?t=1769563175\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/fb16b1bc2e8d96d03c76ea8e98ffb12b.webm?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your mage:\u00a0</strong>Choose the class that matches your playstyle and elements. Unlock class variants as you grow and customize your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.poster.avif?t=1769563175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.webm?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/552b9c776a10d629b3adb9153b40c3af.mp4?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness the elements:\u00a0</strong>Battle with elemental magic where each element has unique properties. Use earth, fire, water, and wind to block, dodge, and deflect your enemy's attacks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/26721b69dc4a2b4673df3abab0a3c145.poster.avif?t=1769563175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/26721b69dc4a2b4673df3abab0a3c145.webm?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/26721b69dc4a2b4673df3abab0a3c145.mp4?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow in Power:\u00a0</strong>Level up and unlock even more epic spells that change how you control the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/55be1df9bbf5db8d695debc94af55ddf.poster.avif?t=1769563175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/55be1df9bbf5db8d695debc94af55ddf.webm?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/55be1df9bbf5db8d695debc94af55ddf.mp4?t=1769563175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Battle Mode:\u00a0</strong>Battle in 3v3 matches to capture crystals and topple towers, face off in duels, or team up in co-op to take on waves of AI. All modes support AI for solo or practice play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786380/extras/a757fea706fcc2c6ef3c10a986dac500.poster.avif?t=1769563175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.